1
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:56,640
You really pissed me off, kid.

2
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:58,799
Stay away from my daughter.

3
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:00,880
Or I'll destroy you.

4
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,600
Gu Ting is the apple of your eye.

5
00:01:04,079 --> 00:01:04,879
I can tell.

6
00:01:05,799 --> 00:01:07,680
You'd even give your life for her.

7
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,079
Tell me.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,760
What's it take to leave my daughter alone?

9
00:01:16,319 --> 00:01:17,599
Let me join you.

10
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,560
There are so many other ways.

11
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,879
Why do you have to keep bothering me?

12
00:01:22,879 --> 00:01:24,200
Because only you can help me.

13
00:01:28,439 --> 00:01:30,079
Who the hell are you?

14
00:01:30,079 --> 00:01:30,879
What are you after?

15
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,640
I've done my research.

16
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:35,599
You have boundaries and a conscience.

17
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,959
And I'm a top-tier programmer.

18
00:01:38,879 --> 00:01:41,400
You scammers will definitely need me.

19
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:46,480
If you don't help me,

20
00:01:47,079 --> 00:01:49,480
I'll send your fraud records to Gu Ting.

21
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,200
Don't you dare!

22
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:54,480
I'll kill you!

23
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:58,079
No, you won't.

24
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,079
If you kill me,

25
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,640
Gu Ting will never forgive you.

26
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,639
Think this through.

27
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,400
It's a crime.

28
00:02:23,639 --> 00:02:26,000
And they'll check your background closely.

29
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,039
Those guys are cautious.

30
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:27,879
Don't worry about that.

31
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:31,039
Just introduce me to them.

32
00:02:35,879 --> 00:02:36,879
Fine, I'll do it.

33
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:38,840
What about my daughter?

34
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,759
I promise I'll talk her into going home.

35
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,639
So I'm supposed to thank you now?

36
00:02:44,039 --> 00:02:44,879
Don't mention it.

37
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,360
Just helping each other out.

38
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:48,960
Uncle.

39
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,039
The cash flow has dropped so much lately.

40
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:10,039
You better give me a good explanation.

41
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:13,080
Boss, the cops are cracking down lately.

42
00:03:13,159 --> 00:03:14,199
What did you call me?

43
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:16,879
I'm sorry, Sir.

44
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:20,439
Hurry up and find me a capable programmer.

45
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:23,000
We have a big deal coming up.

46
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:26,599
Do this right to make up for the losses.

47
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,199
Understood.

48
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:39,599
Keep a close eye on Grass Snake for me.

49
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,560
You're really willing to send me away?

50
00:03:43,439 --> 00:03:44,759
Of course not.

51
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,039
Then...

52
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,400
After this is done,

53
00:03:50,199 --> 00:03:51,560
you'll get everything you deserve.

54
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,800
And...

55
00:03:53,319 --> 00:03:54,520
your freedom.

56
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,360
Bro Snake,

57
00:03:57,639 --> 00:03:59,080
those programmers...

58
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:00,879
screwed up again.

59
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,800
What good are you?!

60
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,479
Get out of here!

61
00:04:02,479 --> 00:04:03,479
You're a bunch of useless trash!

62
00:04:03,479 --> 00:04:04,599
Get the hell out!

63
00:04:10,639 --> 00:04:11,439
Yeah?

64
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,479
Bro Snake,

65
00:04:13,639 --> 00:04:15,560
didn't you ask me to find you some help?

66
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,079
I found someone suitable.

67
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:19,279
And he's a senior programmer.

68
00:04:23,279 --> 00:04:24,480
How's his background?

69
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,480
I did a preliminary check.

70
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,160
Should be no problem.

71
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:30,439
The main thing is,

72
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:32,639
this kid really wants to make money.

73
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,879
Things have been tough lately.

74
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:37,399
Several big deals got intercepted.

75
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:39,160
I'll personally screen him in a few days.

76
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,399
Tell him to get ready.

77
00:04:41,079 --> 00:04:41,759
Will do.

78
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:54,639
Is this girl really staying out all night?

79
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:02,000
I'll teach you a lesson when you get back.

80
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,079
Oh, sweetie!

81
00:05:11,079 --> 00:05:11,879
You're finally back.

82
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:13,240
I was just calling you.

83
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,480
We're so in sync!

84
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,639
I'm staying here for a while,

85
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,680
then I'm moving out.

86
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:20,680
Wait, moving out? Where will you live?

87
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,439
None of your business.

88
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:23,040
I should've been independent long ago.

89
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:24,480
What am I going to do if you leave?

90
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,279
I'll be an empty nester.

91
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,480
Find yourself a partner if you're lonely.

92
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,480
If I find a partner, what about you?

93
00:05:47,519 --> 00:05:49,439
What did you say to my daughter this time?

94
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:51,079
She was crying and screaming to run away.

95
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:52,279
Can you calm down?

96
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,800
I tried talking to her that day.

97
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:55,879
Otherwise, she wouldn't have come home.

98
00:05:56,199 --> 00:05:57,680
You'd better be telling the truth.

99
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,680
I'm not you.

100
00:05:59,040 --> 00:05:59,839
I'm not a liar.

101
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,120
Come here.

102
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:08,240
Bro Snake wants to see you.

103
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:09,680
This Bro Snake has a lot of nicknames.

104
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,399
We all call him Grass Snake.

105
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,959
The guy is extremely arrogant.

106
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:16,199
Watch what you say to his face.

107
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:17,639
Alright.

108
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:18,839
I got it.

109
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:22,319
Did you prepare the story I asked you to?

110
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:23,680
Pretty much.

111
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:27,160
Whether you pass depends on your luck.

112
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,600
I lost 500,000 today.

113
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:49,000
Earn that 500,000 back for me.

114
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,319
Set up a virtual account.

115
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:51,240
Memorize this.

116
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:51,759
Get to work.

117
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:59,079
Now transfer your entire account balance,

118
00:06:59,079 --> 00:07:01,600
and these funds to our official account.

119
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:09,920
You're pretty good, kid.

120
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,399
Police!

121
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:30,800
Stop!

122
00:07:30,879 --> 00:07:31,759
Don't move!

123
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:32,879
Hands up!

124
00:07:48,279 --> 00:07:49,279
I treated you like a brother.

125
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:50,879
Why would you commit crimes?

126
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:51,600
Speak!

127
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,639
Do it!

128
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,519
Enough.

129
00:07:59,759 --> 00:08:00,720
Cut the act.

130
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,480
No one's here.

131
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:13,279
How does it feel?

132
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:14,199
You tell me.

133
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:16,439
By the way,

134
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,000
how is Ms. Lin doing?

135
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:19,959
The police were monitoring the situation.

136
00:08:19,959 --> 00:08:21,199
Her funds are safe.

137
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,560
But she suffered a huge shock,

138
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,240
and attempted suicide.

139
00:08:24,879 --> 00:08:27,160
Our people arrived in time and stopped her.

140
00:08:31,319 --> 00:08:31,920
Ms. Lin!

141
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,039
Ms. Lin, don't do anything rash!

142
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:33,840
Ms. Lin!

143
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:36,840
Ms. Lin, your money can be recovered!

144
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,919
Please don't take your own life!

145
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:39,320
Attempting suicide...

146
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:43,840
These scammers are truly despicable.

147
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,320
Ms. Lin is disabled.

148
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,480
It wasn't easy for her to save that money.

149
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,559
That was meant for her father's surgery.

150
00:08:51,279 --> 00:08:52,279
Thank goodness she's okay.

151
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,360
Your actions were too reckless this time.

152
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,639
If anything had gone wrong,

153
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:58,480
the consequences would be unimaginable.

154
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,120
I know.

155
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,000
I'm glad you know.

156
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,320
I'm curious,

157
00:09:06,399 --> 00:09:08,000
how you got an old fox like Gu Yan

158
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:08,919
to follow your orders.

159
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,279
Well...

160
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,440
I'll keep that a secret for now.

161
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,399
You need to know your limits.

162
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:18,799
We only control the visible operations.

163
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:21,759
There must be a mastermind behind this.

164
00:09:22,919 --> 00:09:24,440
Give me your phone.

165
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,240
What for?

166
00:09:25,639 --> 00:09:26,279
Hand it over.

167
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,559
I downloaded an app for you.

168
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:38,279
So you can track my location anytime.

169
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:40,879
Let me tell you,

170
00:09:41,679 --> 00:09:43,480
this is an illegal invasion of privacy.

171
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,519
I'm not using it commercially.

172
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:49,559
Aren't you worried about my safety?

173
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,240
Fair enough.

174
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,840
For your safety,

175
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,120
you'll have to bear a little pain.

176
00:09:55,759 --> 00:09:56,559
What do you mean?

177
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,159
Go on in.

178
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,600
Welcome back.

179
00:10:29,279 --> 00:10:30,720
Bro Snake. Bro Six.

180
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,799
This is our new location.

181
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,200
Not bad.

182
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:39,360
Bringing in over 500K on your first try.

183
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:42,159
If Six hadn't been so greedy this time,

184
00:10:42,759 --> 00:10:45,039
you'd be the top earner in the company.

185
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,200
Bro Snake, I was just thinking...

186
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,159
Shut up!

187
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:51,080
I know exactly what you're thinking.

188
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,840
You got lucky this time.

189
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,759
You won't be so lucky next time.

190
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,440
Understood.

191
00:10:57,360 --> 00:11:00,480
The cops busted several small platforms.

192
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,759
I'm leaving the new platform setup to you.

193
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,080
Time is tight.

194
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,320
The task is heavy.

195
00:11:05,519 --> 00:11:06,639
Do a good job.

196
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,200
Bro Snake,

197
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,320
do we have a big deal coming up?

198
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:11,679
Ask less,

199
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,120
work more.

200
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:16,279
Work hard, and you'll get your fair share.

201
00:11:16,919 --> 00:11:17,720
Got it, Bro Snake.

202
00:11:17,799 --> 00:11:18,720
I'll definitely work hard.

203
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:23,360
You...

204
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:24,600
don't think I don't know

205
00:11:24,879 --> 00:11:26,120
you and the old man were behind this.

206
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:27,799
Just you wait.

207
00:11:27,799 --> 00:11:29,039
I'll be sure to take good care of you.

208
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,080
Thanks for looking out for me, Bro Six.

209
00:11:43,639 --> 00:11:45,000
I finally got in.

210
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,320
Next,

211
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:49,399
I need to find the past scam lists first.

212
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:52,799
Yaoyao.

213
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,600
I'll find the one who did this to you.

214
00:12:02,919 --> 00:12:05,039
Why hasn't he contacted me yet?

215
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:08,080
Even though I explained I made that up,

216
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:11,080
his reaction was way too indifferent.

217
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,840
Is he really not into me at all?

218
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,919
I finally rented the place.

219
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:44,879
Move.

220
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,000
Behave yourself out there.

221
00:12:50,159 --> 00:12:51,480
Someone will pick you up when it's time.

222
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,480
Got it.

223
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,279
Who are you?

224
00:13:03,279 --> 00:13:04,519
What are you doing in our house?

225
00:13:04,519 --> 00:13:06,159
Hi, I'm the tenant here.

226
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,519
I'm here to sign the lease.

227
00:13:07,519 --> 00:13:08,360
I'm the landlord.

228
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:10,159
But we didn't rent the place to you.

229
00:13:10,919 --> 00:13:12,120
How is that possible?

230
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:14,080
No, I really did rent this place.

231
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:16,120
But you didn't pay me the rent.

232
00:13:20,519 --> 00:13:21,679
Hey, Li Wen.

233
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,120
I got scammed.
